I am sitting on my bed.
It is raining outside.
Staying home today is necessary.
My throat is also hurting.
I cannot go to the office today.
In this condition, I cannot travel by bus.
So, I take my mobile in my hand.
I type a message to my colleague Rohan.
"Hi Rohan, I am not coming to the office today."
"I have caught a bad cold."
"My body is also aching."
"I am taking sick leave today."
"I am going to stay at home and rest."
I send that message to Rohan.
In a few minutes, his reply comes.
"Take care, Maya."
"You should rest completely today."
"Do not worry about the office."
I say thanks to Rohan.
Now I get ready to go to the clinic.
